  "_version": "4.0",
  "_notes": [
    "ARCHITECTURE: Time is a fallback. Perception is the primary stopping condition.",
    "arrival_landmark: landmark scanned for DURING movement \u2014 walk stops early when detected.",
    "arrival_conf: minimum confidence to accept arrival (0.45 color-only, 0.60 template-matched).",
    "Key durations (seconds) are UPPER BOUND TIMEOUTS at 16 studs/s baseline.",
    "The navigator multiplies by 2.5\u00d7 (TIMEOUT_MARGIN) and inverse speed-ratio.",
    "Diagonal keys: two-char strings e.g. 'sa', 'wd', 'wa', 'sd'.",
    "Camera rotation entries: 'rot_rN' (right N taps) or 'rot_lN' (left N taps); duration ignored.",
    "Routes derived from Natro Macro tile data. 1 tile = 4 studs at 16 studs/s baseline.",
    "checkpoint: landmark verified POST-arrival (existing behavior).",
    "upper_platform: intermediate waypoint \u2014 67.5-tile SA diagonal + rot_r4 from spawn."
